# WRIST STRENGTHENING

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

Wrist Strengthening consists of targeted exercises designed to improve wrist stability, forearm strength, grip endurance and impact resilience.

Within CAS, it is considered a foundational robustness intervention for maintaining upper-limb durability in combat athletes.

---

# Philosophy

Every strike,

every grip,

every clinch,

and every pull passes through the wrist.

A resilient wrist improves force transmission while reducing injury risk.

CAS develops wrist capacity to maximize both performance and longevity.

